{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51357","headline":"虎丘西寺 · 刘禹锡","name":"虎丘西寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴王冠剑作尘埃，葬地翻爲七宝台。\n石砌百□光似镜，井轮千转响成雷。\n昔年棣萼联枝发，今日莲宫并蒂开。\n更有女郎坟在此，时时云雨试僧来。\n（康熙顾《虎丘志》三《寺字》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}